This folder contains a text translator that uses three workers to translate the text and uses a packer to add the results to a cabinet.

This design evolved from the original text_translator design when it became aware of an environmental contraint that wouldn't allow the length of the data in a job to be larger than 5000 characters. This is because the API cannot support this. 

The designs behavior was modified to reflect this fact and it now rejects strings that are too long instead of letting it pollute its reality.